<document xmlns="http://cnx.rice.edu/cnxml" xmlns:m="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML">
  <title>7.11.3: Sketching a Graph of a Quadratic Function Using at Least Three Identifiable Points</title>
  <metadata xmlns:md="http://cnx.rice.edu/mdml">
    <md:content-id>m01927</md:content-id>
    <md:title>7.11.3: Sketching a Graph of a Quadratic Function Using at Least Three Identifiable
      Points</md:title>
    <md:uuid>9c96a51e-a9ea-4280-aad8-eae60240f7f5</md:uuid>
  </metadata>
  <content>
    <section class="numbered-exercises" id="sect-00001">      <title>Activity</title>
      <list class="os-raise-noindent" list-type="enumerated" id="list-00001">
        <item>The functions <m:math display="inline">
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mi>f</m:mi>
            </m:mrow>
          </m:math>, <m:math display="inline">
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mi>g</m:mi>
            </m:mrow>
          </m:math>, and <m:math display="inline">
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mi>h</m:mi>
            </m:mrow>
          </m:math> are given. Refer to these
          functions to complete questions a–f.</item>
      </list>
      <table class="unnumbered os-raise-wideequaltable" id="table-00001">
        <tgroup cols="3">
          <tbody>
            <row>
              <entry>
                <emphasis>Equation</emphasis>
              </entry>
              <entry>
                <emphasis><m:math display="inline">
                    <m:mrow>
                      <m:mi>x</m:mi>
                    </m:mrow>
                  </m:math>
                -intercept</emphasis>
              </entry>
              <entry>
                <emphasis><m:math display="inline">
                    <m:mrow>
                      <m:mi>x</m:mi>
                    </m:mrow>
                  </m:math>-coordinate
                of the vertex</emphasis>
              </entry>
            </row>
            <row>
              <entry>
                <para id="para-00001"><m:math>
                    <m:mrow>
                      <m:mi>f</m:mi>
                      <m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo>
                      <m:mi>x</m:mi>
                      <m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>
                      <m:mo>=</m:mo>
                      <m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo>
                      <m:mi>x</m:mi>
                      <m:mo>+</m:mo>
                      <m:mn>3</m:mn>
                      <m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>
                      <m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo>
                      <m:mi>x</m:mi>
                      <m:mo>−</m:mo>
                      <m:mn>5</m:mn>
                      <m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>
                    </m:mrow>
                  </m:math></para></entry>
              <entry>
                <list class="os-raise-noindent" list-type="enumerated" id="list-00002">
                  <item>_____</item>
                </list>
              </entry>
              <entry>
                <list class="os-raise-noindent" list-type="enumerated" id="list-00003">
                  <item>_____</item>
                </list>
              </entry>
            </row>
            <row>
              <entry>
                <para id="para-00002"><m:math>
                    <m:mrow>
                      <m:mi>g</m:mi>
                      <m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo>
                      <m:mi>x</m:mi>
                      <m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>
                      <m:mo>=</m:mo>
                      <m:mn>2</m:mn>
                      <m:mi>x</m:mi>
                      <m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo>
                      <m:mi>x</m:mi>
                      <m:mo>−</m:mo>
                      <m:mn>3</m:mn>
                      <m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>
                    </m:mrow>
                  </m:math></para></entry>
              <entry>
                <list class="os-raise-noindent" list-type="enumerated" id="list-00004">
                  <item>_____</item>
                </list>
              </entry>
              <entry>
                <list class="os-raise-noindent" list-type="enumerated" id="list-00005">
                  <item>_____</item>
                </list>
              </entry>
            </row>
            <row>
              <entry>
                <para id="para-00003"><m:math>
                    <m:mrow>
                      <m:mi>h</m:mi>
                      <m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo>
                      <m:mi>x</m:mi>
                      <m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>
                      <m:mo>=</m:mo>
                      <m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo>
                      <m:mi>x</m:mi>
                      <m:mo>+</m:mo>
                      <m:mn>4</m:mn>
                      <m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>
                      <m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo>
                      <m:mn>4</m:mn>
                      <m:mo>−</m:mo>
